# Production build values — baked in at `npm run build` time. Public URLs
# only; no secrets here (Vite bundles `VITE_*` into the SPA, which is
# shipped to the browser). Override personal values via `.env.production.local`.
#
# Leaving these unset means the SPA derives the API + Keycloak URLs at
# runtime from `window.location.hostname` — perfect for closed-network
# deploys where the box's IP/hostname can change without a rebuild.
# Uncomment + edit when you switch back to a domain-style deploy.
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.kixify.hu
# VITE_KEYCLOAK_AUTHORITY=https://auth.kixify.hu/realms/football-realm
# VITE_FRONTEND_URL=https://kixify.hu
